        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent V. The ICA has issued a contract for you, as tehy think you are the most qualified person for this assignment. You are to travel to the tallest building in the world in Dubai and take out four persons of interest. Among them are:\r\rSheik Omar Al-Ghazali, a ruthless dictator.\r\rCarl Thorn: a man sent to sabotage the local art exhibit.\r\rTommy Marevick: an evil spy dressed as a pilot.\r\rRoberto Franculitta: a terrorist dressed as a chef.\r\rI will leave you to prepare, Agent V. &lt;3",
